WEBVTT

1
00:01:45.109 --> 00:02:00.109
<font color="#ffff80"><b>Fixed & Synced by bozxphd.Enjoy The Flick</b></font>

2
00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.580
Sir, this is Vikas Shankar.

3
00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.000
Mr. Ramesh Tyagi.

4
00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:19.960
Mr.Vedant Chaudhary.

5
00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.750
Mr. Agnivesh Katariya.

6
00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.250
Mr. Junaid Ahmed.

7
00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.620
And Mr. Ashwin Kumar.

8
00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.210
Nandhari Killings?

9
00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.120
Sir Telgi scam.

10
00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.210
Well done Mr. Kumar!

11
00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:34.840
We are proud of you.

12
00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.170
Thank you Sir.

13
00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:49.000
Sir you know, I have seen the files.

14
00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:51.870
I understand... I'll talk to him.

15
00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.460
But where is he?

16
00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.370
There he is!

17
00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.460
- Sir...
- I told you...

18
00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.500
he'd be hiding somewhere...

19
00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.830
and playing his game.

20
00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.870
The Minister wanted to meet you...

21
00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.750
but you were nowhere to be found.

22
00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.620
Sir, I'd told Mr. Pillai about

23
00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.290
my reservation in taking that case.

24
00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.040
And I told Mr. Secretary that,

25
00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.080
Didn't I tell you...

26
00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.500
ordinary murder cases are

27
00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.870
way below Ashwin's standards.

28
00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.500
Look Ashwin... It's not an
ordinary murder case anymore.

29
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.460
The entire middle class
society is shaken up.

30
00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.000
How can a father
murder his own daughter?

31
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.050
I know...

32
00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.870
And even if it's true,
as the police say,

33
00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:35.080
till the CDI does not verify it...

34
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:39.330
The issue will remain stuck
like a fishbone in our throat.

35
00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:42.120
And he tells me you're
the best person

36
00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:45.000
- to handle this for faster results.
- No that's not true...

37
00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.750
The files are in your car.

38
00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.540
Sir may I ask you something?

39
00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.750
Whose idea was it to make the CDI?

40
00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.910
Why?

41
00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.460
What an apt date to celebrate CDI day.

42
00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.800
1st April.

43
00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.090
Give.

44
00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:52.500
Enjoy!

45
00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:07.460
Khempal!

46
00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.500
Khempal!

47
00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.120
Wait a minute!

48
00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.170
His phone isn't connecting.

49
00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.460
Wait five minutes...

50
00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.250
Madam, you have the duplicate key?

51
00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.410
- Yes.

52
00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.000
Throw it from the balcony,
I'll go down and catch it.

53
00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.960
Okay-

54
00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:07.840
Basanti!

55
00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.210
Shruti! Shruti!

56
00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.500
Look at what Khempal has done!

57
00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.340
Sit... sit...

58
00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.210
Sir I had called.

59
00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.340
Where's the body?

60
00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.000
Here in the bedroom.

61
00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:48.000
Goddamn leeches!

62
00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.210
Sorry.

63
00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.340
Same girl?

64
00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:10.840
Is this her?

65
00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:11.960
Yes.

66
00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.340
How old is she?

67
00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.170
I mean, was...

68
00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.670
Fourteen.

69
00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.540
Name?

70
00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.590
Shruti.

71
00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.420
Servant's name?

72
00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.710
Khem pal.

73
00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:34.840
Your name?

74
00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:36.590
Amrish.

75
00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:42.170
You're a neighbor?

76
00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:43.500
She's my niece...

77
00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.620
Lift the sheet at least first!

78
00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.410
What are you doing Champaklal?!

79
00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:52.670
Come Uncle...

80
00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.080
Oh these guys are after me!

81
00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:56.960
Yes Sir...

82
00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.680
These vultures arrive before
the murder even happens.

83
00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.090
- Stay back!
- Move!

84
00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:27.270
- Jai Hind Sir.
- Jai Hind.

85
00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:28.340
Move the bottle.

86
00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.090
Sit.

87
00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.370
Initial inquiries, Sir.

88
00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.500
This is the girl's mother,
that's the father.

89
00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.460
So...

90
00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.370
Any problems in school?

91
00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.550
Any boyfriend?

92
00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.300
She was 14 years old!

93
00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:55.920
I mean...

94
00:10:58.500 --> 00:10:59.550
Any best friend?

95
00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.550
A boy?

96
00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:04.710
Or a girl?

97
00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.780
Why don't you understand officer?

98
00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:08.800
It's Khempal!

99
00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.400
There were four people in the house...

100
00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.420
two are alive, one dead and one missing.

101
00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:18.080
Instead of asking these stupid questions,
go and look for that b******!

102
00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.460
Volume!

103
00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:20.960
Sir is sitting here.

104
00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:22.920
Dhaniram...

105
00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:24.800
listen...

106
00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.120
It is the servant.

107
00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.000
Send one team to the railway station

108
00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.830
one to his house, and neighbors'.

109
00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.940
And one to the mobile company.

110
00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.710
It's an open and shut case!

111
00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:43.590
5 feet 2 inches.

112
00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:45.420
Weight medium.

113
00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:48.370
Color wheatish

114
00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.250
I'm sending you a photo now.
Go and give this quickly.

115
00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.210
Tell me...

116
00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.710
Sir the Gorakhpur express leaves at 7pm.

117
00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:12.290
That means he should still
be in the city somewhere.

118
00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.790
Do you have anyone with you
for identification?

119
00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:14.790
Yes Sir.

120
00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.500
Dr. Tandon's compounder.

121
00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.840
He's also from Khempal's village.

122
00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.300
Good.

123
00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.790
Okay-

124
00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:22.840
Okay Sir.

125
00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.330
Khempal is a lustful guy.

126
00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.340
And quite randy too.

127
00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:31.730
He had a thing for Shruti baby.

128
00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.550
But he's a grandfather...

129
00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.120
he even has two grandchildren.

130
00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:36.160
SQ?

131
00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.540
He too has a heart that beats...

132
00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:42.100
Is this a murder or a suicide?

133
00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.160
You still don't know? It's murder.

134
00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.900
The servant killed her and ran away.

135
00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.970
Carefully... She's a little girl...!

136
00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.590
Relax...

137
00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:04.700
- Sir! A byte please! -

138
00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.830
- Dr.Tandon!
Why did your servant do this? -

139
00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.460
Sir, the whole room is a blood bath.
The sheets are soaked red.

140
00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:25.960
Yes Sir... I'm at Sameer Vihar...

141
00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:27.460
No Sir, don't say that...

142
00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.020
I'll... I'll post someone
else here and come.

143
00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.210
Yes Sir... Jai Hind.

144
00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:37.370
We've taken the samples right?

145
00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.290
So... Can we put them
on the terrace to dry?

146
00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.430
You can put your sheets...

147
00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.550
and your blankets...

148
00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:46.850
in your cupboards, or lockers
or even where the sun don't shine.

149
00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:47.960
What do I care?

150
00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.660
Right sir.

151
00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:50.920
Am I cracking jokes here?

152
00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.500
No Sir. Absolutely right Sir...

153
00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:09.590
Sir!

154
00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:10.960
Sir, one minute!

155
00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:13.720
There are blood stains on
the stairs and the door.

156
00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.070
Gopal, I'll call you later...

157
00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:21.960
You come along.

158
00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:26.840
Key?

159
00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.870
It's missing. You can break the lock.

160
00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:32.340
Very good!

161
00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.710
Thieves break locks. Not cops!

162
00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.620
Parched eyes will see water everywhere!

163
00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.710
It's just rust, not blood!

164
00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:44.800
And what's this?

165
00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.500
On the stairs?

166
00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:50.710
That?

167
00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:54.840
That's blood!

168
00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.790
Yes Sir...

169
00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.000
I've left Sir...

170
00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.370
I'm in the jeep.

171
00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:50.460
Mr. and Mrs. Kumar,
you want a divorce on mutual consent.

172
00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.960
But before giving you
a 6 month trial separation...

173
00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:57.250
I must ask why you want to separate?

174
00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.000
Mr. Kumar?

175
00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:02.870
I don't have any reason as such.

176
00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.590
Mrs. Kumar?

177
00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:08.080
You filed the court papers didn't you?

178
00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:12.530
If there's no reason to separate then
there's no reason to be together either...

179
00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.650
We sleep together and wake up
together for no reason.

180
00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:19.250
Fight for no reason.
Love each other for no reason.

181
00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.750
Our relationship died years ago.

182
00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.120
And we're rotting...

183
00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:28.870
in the stench of the corpse...
again for no reason.

184
00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:32.250
We also had affairs...

185
00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.660
Would you also like to know whom with?

186
00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:38.710
Not really...

187
00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.460
Go ahead, tell her.

188
00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.790
I will if she grants us the divorce faster.

189
00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:45.250
Always great at bullshitting.

190
00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.750
Please turn that off.

191
00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.550
Hello?

192
00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.550
Yes...

193
00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.670
What?

194
00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.460
We showed him the blood
stains on the lock yesterday.

195
00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.210
He ridiculed us.

196
00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:24.970
My uncle finally broke the lock.

197
00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.460
Mr. D K Gogia...

198
00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.360
Retired police officer.

199
00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:33.000
He came as soon as I called him.

200
00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.420
Identify the body please.

201
00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.570
Took it from all angles?

202
00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.260
It does look like Khempal...

203
00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.090
Wow!

204
00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.300
'Looks like'?

205
00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:00.840
What do you mean?

206
00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:05.500
Worked for you for two years, didn't he?

207
00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.460
Can you come up?

208
00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.750
I can't come home with the ashes.

209
00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.370
Panditji has said not to...

210
00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.620
Leave it in the car.

211
00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.370
I'm not leaving her alone.

212
00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:37.580
Do you remember what Khempal
was wearing last night?

213
00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:41.580
Pant and?

214
00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.340
Er...

215
00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.340
A green T-shirt?

216
00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.870
- Now one with Pankaj...
- Okay.

217
00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.710
One more...

218
00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.090
Sir!

219
00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.460
Sir check this out...

220
00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.090
Hold on...

221
00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:20.920
I'll call later...

222
00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:23.680
Would you look at that!

223
00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.380
Guess the case is solved!

224
00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:27.340
Pandey!

225
00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:30.250
- Call the forensics department.
- Yes sir.

226
00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:42.250
The body is Khempal's.

227
00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:44.590
Alright.

228
00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.000
And this handprint?

229
00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.210
Yours?

230
00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.340
Sorry.

231
00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.740
The Shruti Tandon murder case
keeps twisting and turning.

232
00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.250
A new body has been found today.

233
00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.750
Apparently this is the body
of the servant...

234
00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.920
who was presumed to be
the killer until now.

235
00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.050
Name?

236
00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:13.460
Name?

237
00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.580
Shruti Tandon.

238
00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.590
Age?

239
00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:20.920
14 years.

240
00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.050
Date of birth?

241
00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.420
24th March.

242
00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:27.590
Date of death?

243
00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.370
15th March.

244
00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:33.870
Time of death?

245
00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:43.620
Sir?

246
00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:45.620
Time of death, please?

247
00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:49.300
Sir?

248
00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:26.690
Sir the killer is very clever...

249
00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.000
Does that mean we are buffoons?

250
00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.000
If we don't do something quick,

251
00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.640
like Nandhari, this case too
will go to the CDI.

252
00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.870
And if I get transferred...

253
00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:37.300
I will not go alone.

254
00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:39.450
Either find the killer,

255
00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.580
or find another job!

256
00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:44.460
Yes Sir!

257
00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:52.210
Fresh arrivals...

258
00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:02.500
First she was hit on the head...

259
00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.120
with a hammer or a rod...

260
00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:05.840
twice.

261
00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:07.870
She must've fallen unconscious.

262
00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:09.710
Then almost half an hour later...

263
00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:12.830
very carefully, as if by an expert...

264
00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:15.000
right at the jugular vein...

265
00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:16.460
a long cut.

266
00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:17.550
Number one.

267
00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:20.500
And then for satisfaction,

268
00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:22.750
another small late cut...

269
00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:24.210
number two.

270
00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:27.420
And the servant?

271
00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:28.840
A Xerox copy.

272
00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:33.750
Xerox copy indeed.

273
00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:04.160
What happened?

274
00:23:04.160 --> 00:23:05.300
Sir it's me, Dhaniram!

275
00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:06.800
One minute sir.

276
00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.040
Sir... a glass broke in the other room...

277
00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:16.040
you were in deep sleep,
tired after a long day's work...

278
00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:18.330
and you still woke up, immediately!

279
00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.500
SQ?

280
00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:20.410
Sir...

281
00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:23.620
two people died in the next room...

282
00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:27.370
yet Daddy and Mommy kept snoring away.

283
00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:29.430
Just think about it Sir.

284
00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:35.080
Check out this email.

285
00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:40.080
This girl is apologizing to her father -

286
00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:43.120
'I'm sorry Daddy, I won't do it again'.

287
00:23:44.290 --> 00:23:45.910
What was this mistake you think?

288
00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:53.210
And not just one mistake,
but three of them.

289
00:23:54.250 --> 00:23:56.080
The three mistakes of Chetan Bhagat...

290
00:23:57.750 --> 00:23:58.800
she was reading this.

291
00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:00.870
We found it in her room.

292
00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.120
And here is the internet company's report.

293
00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:11.160
They said, even hours
after the girl's death...

294
00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:14.580
the internet router kept
switching on and off.

295
00:24:15.290 --> 00:24:17.030
So if Daddy and Mommy were sleeping...

296
00:24:19.160 --> 00:24:20.210
and the girl was dead...

297
00:24:21.290 --> 00:24:23.270
who was switching the router on and off?

298
00:24:24.040 --> 00:24:25.090
The girl's ghost?

299
00:24:29.870 --> 00:24:31.210
Damn right!

300
00:24:36.500 --> 00:24:38.370
There were four people in the house...

301
00:24:38.910 --> 00:24:41.000
two are alive and two dead.

302
00:24:42.410 --> 00:24:43.730
What are you trying to say?

303
00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:48.370
Just that there were two
murders that night...

304
00:24:50.040 --> 00:24:55.580
and both of you heard nothing...
Not a sound?

305
00:24:57.120 --> 00:24:59.370
The AC in our room is so loud that

306
00:24:59.370 --> 00:25:00.990
you can't hear any outside noise.

307
00:25:01.540 --> 00:25:04.370
Wow that's convenient and
a hell of an AC!

308
00:25:05.040 --> 00:25:08.620
So I guess the noise inside the room
can't go outside either eh?

309
00:25:09.890 --> 00:25:14.790
The horniest guy I know is
actually Shruti's father.

310
00:25:14.790 --> 00:25:15.660
Really?!

311
00:25:15.660 --> 00:25:19.000
The female doctor in his clinic...

312
00:25:19.540 --> 00:25:20.590
Sunita madam?

313
00:25:20.590 --> 00:25:21.790
That's the one.

314
00:25:21.790 --> 00:25:23.120
He used to hook up with her.

315
00:25:23.290 --> 00:25:24.340
Unbelievable!

316
00:25:25.370 --> 00:25:27.410
You loved your daughter a lot didn't you?

317
00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.050
And your wife?

318
00:25:32.160 --> 00:25:33.210
What?

319
00:25:33.540 --> 00:25:35.120
Our marriage is just fine.

320
00:25:35.870 --> 00:25:37.080
Of course, of course!

321
00:25:38.660 --> 00:25:41.000
Every man loves his wife...

322
00:25:42.790 --> 00:25:44.370
And if he doesn't, he at least...

323
00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:46.620
pretends like he loves his wife...

324
00:25:52.160 --> 00:25:54.120
And Doctor Mrs. Nathani?

325
00:25:56.040 --> 00:25:58.500
Did you love her too?

326
00:25:59.250 --> 00:26:01.160
Are you insane?!

327
00:26:01.160 --> 00:26:03.000
Shrieking won't help...

328
00:26:03.410 --> 00:26:04.960
I'm a happily married woman!

329
00:26:04.960 --> 00:26:06.290
I know...

330
00:26:06.290 --> 00:26:09.290
Sir I've also heard
that this loving couple

331
00:26:09.290 --> 00:26:11.330
used to indulge in some sex switcheroo...

332
00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:13.050
What?

333
00:26:14.160 --> 00:26:15.780
You know what they say in English...

334
00:26:16.870 --> 00:26:18.130
You know... switching wives...

335
00:26:18.540 --> 00:26:19.870
Wife... soap...

336
00:26:20.160 --> 00:26:21.210
Wife swapping?!

337
00:26:21.210 --> 00:26:24.250
How is all this connected
with Shruti's murder?

338
00:26:24.250 --> 00:26:26.870
Oh it is connected... from both ends.

339
00:26:27.750 --> 00:26:29.870
Shruti got to know what
you two were up to...

340
00:26:31.160 --> 00:26:32.870
She had become sad...

341
00:26:33.250 --> 00:26:34.300
always sad.

342
00:26:34.910 --> 00:26:36.120
It's a tragedy dear...

343
00:26:37.160 --> 00:26:39.000
poor girl was suffering silently.

344
00:26:40.910 --> 00:26:43.620
She could neither tell her friends
nor her relatives...

345
00:26:44.040 --> 00:26:45.090
so who else?

346
00:26:46.160 --> 00:26:47.210
Khempal.

347
00:26:48.660 --> 00:26:49.740
He was very afraid Sir.

348
00:26:50.790 --> 00:26:52.770
He had even told me his life was in danger.

349
00:26:53.160 --> 00:26:54.210
From who?

350
00:26:55.540 --> 00:26:57.500
It was her birthday 8 days later...

351
00:26:59.000 --> 00:27:00.620
but we gave her gift early...

352
00:27:02.540 --> 00:27:04.520
You have seen the videos from that night...

353
00:27:05.250 --> 00:27:07.120
we loved her a lot.

354
00:27:07.410 --> 00:27:08.960
For her birthday she had...

355
00:27:09.910 --> 00:27:11.580
planned a sleepover...

356
00:27:12.410 --> 00:27:14.120
with her friends.

357
00:27:15.660 --> 00:27:17.040
Planned what with friends?

358
00:27:18.790 --> 00:27:19.840
Sleep?

359
00:27:22.250 --> 00:27:23.300
What is that?

360
00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:28.750
All the kids spend a night together
at one friend's place. Alone.

361
00:27:30.540 --> 00:27:32.370
Without parents around?

362
00:27:34.000 --> 00:27:35.870
And what do they do the whole night?

363
00:27:39.160 --> 00:27:41.460
You see, all these things...

364
00:27:42.620 --> 00:27:44.250
are because of the internet...

365
00:27:48.160 --> 00:27:50.080
it's a wretched place, this internet.

366
00:28:00.160 --> 00:28:02.250
Shruti - that's the girls name.

367
00:28:02.250 --> 00:28:03.300
Correct.

368
00:28:03.870 --> 00:28:06.580
She died on 15th March.

369
00:28:07.000 --> 00:28:08.620
And the time?

370
00:28:09.290 --> 00:28:11.500
They said she died at 2:00 am.

371
00:28:13.910 --> 00:28:14.960
Perfect.

372
00:28:15.290 --> 00:28:17.370
Make me a photocopy of this.

373
00:28:18.160 --> 00:28:20.120
If you didn't kill her...

374
00:28:20.540 --> 00:28:24.000
how do you know she died at 2:00 am?

375
00:28:36.360 --> 00:28:38.410
Hold it!

376
00:28:38.410 --> 00:28:40.390
We're from the Anti-Corruption Bureau.

377
00:28:41.790 --> 00:28:42.840
Hey Guru!

378
00:28:43.540 --> 00:28:45.620
JK! What are you doing here mate?

379
00:28:46.290 --> 00:28:48.370
Got a deputation coming up.

380
00:28:48.540 --> 00:28:50.500
Okay! Where are you off to?

381
00:28:51.870 --> 00:28:53.500
Probably CDI.

382
00:28:53.910 --> 00:28:55.290
But what are you doing here?

383
00:28:55.910 --> 00:28:57.050
The double murder case...

384
00:28:57.050 --> 00:28:58.370
that young girl and the servant.

385
00:28:58.370 --> 00:28:59.750
Ah yes yes Yes"- ...

386
00:29:00.160 --> 00:29:01.900
Just reporting to the high command.

387
00:29:02.320 --> 00:29:04.370
Any leads?

388
00:29:04.370 --> 00:29:05.420
We are working on it.

389
00:29:05.500 --> 00:29:06.640
We have cracked it Sir!

390
00:29:07.910 --> 00:29:08.960
Sorry Sir.

391
00:29:11.290 --> 00:29:14.120
I've got some fine malt for you - imported!

392
00:29:14.500 --> 00:29:15.580
Why don't you come by?

393
00:29:18.370 --> 00:29:19.420
Day after tomorrow?

394
00:29:19.660 --> 00:29:20.710
Done. - Done.

395
00:29:21.290 --> 00:29:22.710
Thank you. - Okay dear.

396
00:29:32.240 --> 00:29:34.000
It's been 10 days!

397
00:29:34.000 --> 00:29:36.410
What has the police
been doing about this case?

398
00:29:37.290 --> 00:29:38.500
Wait... wait... wait...

399
00:29:38.910 --> 00:29:40.230
We are pleased to announce...

400
00:29:40.660 --> 00:29:43.000
that we have solved
the double murder case...

401
00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:44.870
of Kruti and the servant.

402
00:29:45.250 --> 00:29:46.370
Its, Shruti not Kruti.

403
00:29:46.660 --> 00:29:47.710
Sir, Shruti.

404
00:29:50.160 --> 00:29:52.620
Our investigation has discovered that

405
00:29:52.790 --> 00:29:54.370
both the murders have been

406
00:29:54.540 --> 00:29:56.000
committed by the same person.

407
00:30:02.410 --> 00:30:05.040
He found Kruti...
I mean Shruti and Khempal

408
00:30:05.040 --> 00:30:08.120
in an objectionable though
not compromising position.

409
00:30:15.120 --> 00:30:16.170
Mr. Ramesh?

410
00:30:22.910 --> 00:30:25.750
We need to get some identification done.

411
00:30:31.290 --> 00:30:35.210
After seeing his daughter
and his servant together,

412
00:30:36.120 --> 00:30:40.120
Dr. Ramesh killed them
both in a fit of anger...

413
00:30:40.540 --> 00:30:45.120
though he is as characterless
as his daughter was!

414
00:30:45.750 --> 00:30:48.790
What I say, he is as characterless,
as his daughter was...

415
00:30:48.790 --> 00:30:51.010
[Reporter] What do you mean characterless?

416
00:30:52.160 --> 00:30:55.960
There's a new twist and a new killer
in the double murder case.

417
00:30:59.160 --> 00:31:02.000
This is a simple and straight
case of honor killing.

418
00:31:08.370 --> 00:31:09.420
Nutan?

419
00:31:09.790 --> 00:31:10.840
Where are you both?

420
00:31:10.870 --> 00:31:11.920
Where is Ramesh?

421
00:31:12.620 --> 00:31:14.620
We're in a police building...

422
00:31:15.040 --> 00:31:19.000
they've taken Ramesh in
for some identification.

423
00:31:19.660 --> 00:31:20.710
Listen to me...

424
00:31:21.040 --> 00:31:22.540
they're saying he killed her!

425
00:31:22.790 --> 00:31:25.310
They're saying Ramesh
killed Shruti and Khempal!

426
00:31:26.370 --> 00:31:27.420
What!

427
00:31:28.000 --> 00:31:29.800
What do you mean? Who is saying that?

428
00:31:29.800 --> 00:31:31.120
Listen.

429
00:31:31.120 --> 00:31:35.000
Police say Shruti and Khempal's murderer is

430
00:31:35.000 --> 00:31:37.340
none other than Shruti's
father Ramesh Tandon.

431
00:31:37.500 --> 00:31:40.150
This is a simple and straight
case of Honour Killing.

432
00:31:42.040 --> 00:31:43.370
Where is Ramesh?

433
00:31:43.540 --> 00:31:44.590
He's inside.

434
00:31:44.590 --> 00:31:45.750
Ma'am, you're not allowed there.

435
00:31:45.750 --> 00:31:47.920
What do you mean not allowed?
I'm his wife!

436
00:31:48.540 --> 00:31:49.960
Open the door!

437
00:31:49.960 --> 00:31:50.910
What happened?

438
00:31:50.910 --> 00:31:53.000
My husband Dr. Ramesh Tandon,

439
00:31:53.000 --> 00:31:54.500
he's been locked up inside.

440
00:31:54.750 --> 00:31:55.890
There's no one inside,

441
00:31:56.160 --> 00:31:57.210
take a look...

442
00:32:08.160 --> 00:32:09.210
Satisfied?

443
00:32:11.620 --> 00:32:13.460
I want to speak to my lawyer.

444
00:32:15.870 --> 00:32:17.960
A lawyer is of no use now.

445
00:32:19.120 --> 00:32:22.250
Confess, and you'll get away
with a lighter punishment.

446
00:32:24.660 --> 00:32:27.370
Yours is the rarest of the rare cases.

447
00:32:30.120 --> 00:32:33.250
You'll be hung, and it'll be
granted by a fast track court.

448
00:32:35.290 --> 00:32:36.910
Why would I kill my own daughter?

449
00:32:37.910 --> 00:32:39.650
I've already told you why you did it.

450
00:32:42.910 --> 00:32:45.500
Should I also tell you how?

451
00:32:48.040 --> 00:32:50.620
You were working on your
laptop till late that night.

452
00:32:53.290 --> 00:32:55.330
You drink every night, anyway...

453
00:32:56.410 --> 00:32:59.370
But that night you had a
few extra, perhaps...

454
00:33:03.040 --> 00:33:04.500
Khempal, get some ice.

455
00:33:13.540 --> 00:33:14.590
Khempal.

456
00:34:51.910 --> 00:34:54.750
Nutan... help please!

457
00:36:12.290 --> 00:36:17.330
After committing both murders,
you cleaned the blood in the room...

458
00:36:20.250 --> 00:36:24.500
wiped your fingerprints off everything.

459
00:36:26.910 --> 00:36:30.500
The bed... the room...
you dressed it all up very nicely.

460
00:36:33.160 --> 00:36:36.750
Satisfied with everything,
you relaxed with another drink.

461
00:36:42.160 --> 00:36:44.120
Would you like to confess now?

462
00:36:46.910 --> 00:36:47.960
Please...

463
00:36:49.660 --> 00:36:52.870
Please.. let me talk to my wife...

464
00:36:54.040 --> 00:36:55.090
lawyer...

465
00:36:57.540 --> 00:36:59.540
I didn't do this...

466
00:36:59.540 --> 00:37:03.000
I didn't kill my daughter...
Please believe me!

467
00:37:03.790 --> 00:37:05.710
Sir please!

468
00:37:06.910 --> 00:37:08.870
Please... I did not kill her.

469
00:37:09.250 --> 00:37:10.300
Please Sir...

470
00:37:11.250 --> 00:37:12.300
Please!

471
00:37:14.040 --> 00:37:17.750
This is the compound!
This is where it happened!

472
00:37:18.040 --> 00:37:20.500
Shruti was killed here!

473
00:37:20.870 --> 00:37:24.160
This is the house
where Shruti was born...

474
00:37:24.160 --> 00:37:27.370
this is the room where she grew up.

475
00:37:27.870 --> 00:37:32.870
This is the room where that
bloodcurdling nightmare happened!

476
00:37:33.250 --> 00:37:35.870
This is where Shruti
was brutally murdered...

477
00:37:36.250 --> 00:37:39.370
where a father was overcome
by anger and reacted violently...

478
00:37:40.040 --> 00:37:43.410
when he saw his
daughter with the servant

479
00:37:43.410 --> 00:37:44.870
in a compromising position!

480
00:37:45.160 --> 00:37:48.210
A street dog barking at
night keeps us awake...

481
00:37:48.210 --> 00:37:50.620
and their daughter was
murdered in the next room

482
00:37:50.620 --> 00:37:52.120
yet they never woke up?

483
00:37:52.540 --> 00:37:55.080
It's not just fishy... it's a fishmarket!

484
00:37:55.620 --> 00:37:57.790
We all have boyfriends...

485
00:37:57.790 --> 00:37:59.750
but an old man?
Yuck!

486
00:38:00.790 --> 00:38:03.830
And suddenly one morning,
our family was finished...

487
00:38:05.750 --> 00:38:09.460
Before we could even mourn over our loss,
they arrested him.

488
00:38:11.500 --> 00:38:13.120
Shruti was Ramesh's everything.

489
00:38:14.790 --> 00:38:17.500
He had never even so much as slapped her,

490
00:38:18.290 --> 00:38:20.500
yet the police, media
everybody is saying...

491
00:38:24.410 --> 00:38:26.250
I have faith in the legal system.

492
00:38:28.790 --> 00:38:30.870
I hope justice is done.

493
00:38:31.160 --> 00:38:32.250
Of course.

494
00:38:32.250 --> 00:38:37.500
<i>The day the sky is unscathed</i>

495
00:38:40.290 --> 00:38:45.620
<i>the face of the moon unblemished,</i>

496
00:38:48.290 --> 00:38:53.620
<i>the day Time awakens</i>

497
00:38:56.290 --> 00:38:59.120
<i>justice! Justice!</i>

498
00:38:59.120 --> 00:39:01.710
<i>Justice shall be sewed!</i>

499
00:39:04.410 --> 00:39:06.620
If you have just lost your child...

500
00:39:06.790 --> 00:39:10.210
that also under really
horrible circumstances...

501
00:39:10.620 --> 00:39:13.370
How can you be so clinical and so logical?

502
00:39:14.120 --> 00:39:17.370
I saw Mrs. Tandon's interview
on your channel.

503
00:39:17.910 --> 00:39:21.120
I felt as if perhaps she isn't
even their own daughter...

504
00:39:21.910 --> 00:39:23.290
she may be adopted...

505
00:39:23.290 --> 00:39:25.580
I suggest we should
have a DNA test done.

506
00:39:25.790 --> 00:39:29.250
DNA test suggests Delhi's
famous socialite Shoma Ray.

507
00:39:31.620 --> 00:39:33.000
Blood relation or not...

508
00:39:34.290 --> 00:39:41.750
the police has no right to defame
such a small child, who is dead!

509
00:39:42.410 --> 00:39:46.210
I think that policeman should not be
allowed to remain on his post.

510
00:39:47.790 --> 00:39:50.120
After going through the case details,

511
00:39:50.660 --> 00:39:55.250
the Home Ministry has requested the
CDI to take over the case...

512
00:39:55.540 --> 00:39:58.620
Based on the findings of the
CDl's investigation...

513
00:39:58.790 --> 00:40:03.250
further action will be taken
against whomsoever it may be.

514
00:40:04.790 --> 00:40:07.750
After the embarrassing work
by the police, the CDI team

515
00:40:07.910 --> 00:40:09.620
has now arrived in the area.

516
00:40:09.790 --> 00:40:11.790
The case will now be handled by.

517
00:40:11.790 --> 00:40:13.620
CDI joint director Ashwin Kumar.

518
00:40:42.790 --> 00:40:45.750
Doctor, this is the girl's room...

519
00:40:47.160 --> 00:40:49.210
that's the servant's room...

520
00:40:51.160 --> 00:40:52.710
let's get cracking!

521
00:41:18.290 --> 00:41:19.710
Found anything?

522
00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:25.460
2-3 bottles of beer and wine,
and some toiletries in the bathroom...

523
00:41:27.160 --> 00:41:29.930
'Serve you parents... take them
to the four holy shrines'

524
00:41:30.790 --> 00:41:34.750
'Feeding a cow would help
rid the house of evil spirits'

525
00:41:35.790 --> 00:41:38.370
'Feeding a dog will defeat your enemies'

526
00:41:42.790 --> 00:41:45.000
Did Khempal drink?

527
00:41:45.790 --> 00:41:47.750
Occasionally or everyday?

528
00:41:48.790 --> 00:41:50.750
He never touched alcohol.

529
00:41:52.790 --> 00:41:55.460
He smoked beedis though,
on the terrace.

530
00:41:55.660 --> 00:41:56.710
Sir?

531
00:41:57.910 --> 00:41:59.620
Could you come here for a second?

532
00:42:01.860 --> 00:42:03.750
Okay...

533
00:42:03.750 --> 00:42:05.210
Whose bottles are these?

534
00:42:07.120 --> 00:42:08.830
I don't know...

535
00:42:19.410 --> 00:42:23.370
Sir these bloodstains are not only
between the terrace and Tandon's flat...

536
00:42:24.250 --> 00:42:26.660
they are on the lower floors
as well, going down.

537
00:42:27.300 --> 00:42:34.040
They could have been made when
the police was bringing the body down?

538
00:42:34.040 --> 00:42:35.090
Possible, Sir...

539
00:42:36.040 --> 00:42:37.500
totally contrary to the FIR.

540
00:42:38.540 --> 00:42:41.080
That means Khempal walked
to the terrace himself...

541
00:42:41.080 --> 00:42:42.910
alive...

542
00:42:42.910 --> 00:42:45.830
Ah! We only need some
background music now...

543
00:42:45.830 --> 00:42:47.910
You are truly Sherlock Holmes, Vedant!

544
00:42:47.910 --> 00:42:50.120
You flatter me Sir!

545
00:43:04.660 --> 00:43:05.710
Have a seat.

546
00:43:09.410 --> 00:43:12.750
Ahh goddamn it! You fool!

547
00:43:17.290 --> 00:43:20.120
Dr. Tandon, I'm Ashwin Kumar
I'm handling your case...

548
00:43:23.290 --> 00:43:26.060
What time did you go to sleep
on the night of 15th March?

549
00:43:26.410 --> 00:43:27.960
Around 11 pm...

550
00:43:29.660 --> 00:43:32.660
That night, the internet router
switched on and off

551
