Relax... He just lost his temper...

815
01:04:52.540 --> 01:04:54.620
He's a good man...

816
01:04:54.870 --> 01:04:56.620
I will take my revenge at any cost...

817
01:04:57.040 --> 01:04:58.960
I will show him who the real b****** is!

818
01:05:05.660 --> 01:05:07.250
Are you sure about this?

819
01:05:07.250 --> 01:05:10.660
Sir, whatever the parents have said so far

820
01:05:10.660 --> 01:05:13.070
in the investigation,
has turned out to be true.

821
01:05:13.660 --> 01:05:15.640
Nutan had called Khempal in the morning...

822
01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:19.120
Then the AC sound test in the room...

823
01:05:20.120 --> 01:05:22.460
They even passed the polygraph tests

824
01:05:22.620 --> 01:05:23.870
without a hitch.

825
01:05:27.040 --> 01:05:29.330
You better hope all this
turns out to be wrong.

826
01:05:31.790 --> 01:05:33.250
Or the torture and injustice

827
01:05:33.250 --> 01:05:35.240
that the parents have
been put through...

828
01:05:35.870 --> 01:05:37.870
One won't be able to
make amends for it...

829
01:05:38.910 --> 01:05:40.000
Even“.

830
01:05:41.410 --> 01:05:42.500
Ashwin...

831
01:05:44.160 --> 01:05:46.250
Have you seen the statue of justice?

832
01:05:48.540 --> 01:05:50.500
It is blindfolded...

833
01:05:50.660 --> 01:05:52.400
and one hand holds a weight balance...

834
01:05:53.290 --> 01:05:56.210
People often don't notice

835
01:05:56.410 --> 01:05:58.620
that the other hand holds a sword.

836
01:06:01.660 --> 01:06:04.250
The sword in the hands of justice is us...

837
01:06:04.500 --> 01:06:05.550
us cops...

838
01:06:07.160 --> 01:06:09.160
But in the last 60 years,

839
01:06:09.160 --> 01:06:10.710
the sword has become rusty...

840
01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:14.620
And until the rust is cleaned off,

841
01:06:16.370 --> 01:06:20.120
this is how it will be... how it will stay.

842
01:06:23.250 --> 01:06:26.000
I'm retiring on the 19th of next month.

843
01:06:27.660 --> 01:06:28.710
I know...

844
01:06:30.910 --> 01:06:33.250
You have 32 days...

845
01:06:34.410 --> 01:06:36.250
to clean the rust off the sword.

846
01:06:38.250 --> 01:06:43.370
<i>The day the sky is unscathed</i>

847
01:06:46.370 --> 01:06:51.250
<i>the face of the moon unblemished,</i>

848
01:06:54.410 --> 01:07:00.330
<i>the day Time awakens</i>

849
01:07:02.540 --> 01:07:04.960
<i>justice! Justice!</i>

850
01:07:05.120 --> 01:07:07.330
<i>Justice shall be sewed!</i>

851
01:07:16.000 --> 01:07:17.830
Nothing in here...

852
01:07:18.830 --> 01:07:20.210
I'll check on the other side.

853
01:07:25.370 --> 01:07:27.500
Basu! Find anything?

854
01:07:27.500 --> 01:07:28.790
Looking Sir.

855
01:07:38.460 --> 01:07:39.510
- Ashwin... -

856
01:07:47.540 --> 01:07:48.790
Please keep this.

857
01:07:59.620 --> 01:08:00.670
Hey...

858
01:08:01.710 --> 01:08:02.760
What... is this?

859
01:08:09.870 --> 01:08:12.210
I think we've found
our murder weapon...

860
01:08:18.530 --> 01:08:20.500
Yes Vedant...

861
01:08:20.500 --> 01:08:22.480
We've got permission for the Narco test...

862
01:08:22.870 --> 01:08:25.000
Good... very good!

863
01:08:31.960 --> 01:08:37.500
Investigative officers are
not allowed in Narco tests.

864
01:08:37.500 --> 01:08:40.000
Doc I'm on the verge
of solving this case...

865
01:08:40.000 --> 01:08:42.410
I just need one breakthrough!

866
01:08:42.410 --> 01:08:43.620
Pestering like a child!

867
01:08:43.620 --> 01:08:45.410
You know I can't help you with this...

868
01:08:45.830 --> 01:08:47.570
Okay, could you give me your phone?

869
01:08:49.040 --> 01:08:50.090
Who are you calling?

870
01:08:52.000 --> 01:08:53.050
Calling myself.

871
01:08:53.070 --> 01:08:56.330
I think he picked up... Please speak!

872
01:08:56.330 --> 01:08:58.250
Hello... Dr. Swamy?

873
01:08:58.250 --> 01:08:59.370
What is this?

874
01:08:59.370 --> 01:09:00.330
This is a live telecast...

875
01:09:00.330 --> 01:09:01.380
Don't hang up...

876
01:09:01.580 --> 01:09:03.260
We're not breaking the law, okay?

877
01:09:03.960 --> 01:09:05.500
If I need to ask any questions

878
01:09:05.500 --> 01:09:07.330
I'll text doctor Mohanty.

879
01:09:08.910 --> 01:09:10.620
Thank you!

880
01:09:25.580 --> 01:09:26.840
This is Sodium Pentathol.

881
01:09:27.290 --> 01:09:29.120
You will feel a bit drowsy...

882
01:09:29.790 --> 01:09:32.120
but you will remain awake.

883
01:09:45.040 --> 01:09:46.090
He is stable...

884
01:09:46.460 --> 01:09:47.710
you can begin now.

885
01:09:51.960 --> 01:09:53.250
Kanhaiya?

886
01:09:54.290 --> 01:09:55.340
Kanhaiya?

887
01:09:56.250 --> 01:09:57.540
Yes Sir.

888
01:09:57.710 --> 01:10:00.000
Tell us something about
Shruti and Khempal?

889
01:10:01.080 --> 01:10:03.670
Was there really something
going on between them?

890
01:10:06.410 --> 01:10:07.460
Kanhaiya?

891
01:10:11.410 --> 01:10:12.460
No Sir.

892
01:10:13.370 --> 01:10:16.870
He loved her like his own daughter...

893
01:10:17.410 --> 01:10:18.460
Then?

894
01:10:19.460 --> 01:10:22.080
RP was the one who loved her...

895
01:10:24.540 --> 01:10:25.590
Who is RP?

896
01:10:27.210 --> 01:10:28.540
Rajpal...

897
01:10:30.210 --> 01:10:32.080
Nathani Sir's driver.

898
01:10:32.830 --> 01:10:34.830
When was the last time
you met Khempal?

899
01:10:41.210 --> 01:10:42.410
At the Rockhouse...

900
01:10:43.080 --> 01:10:45.710
What is Rockhouse?

901
01:10:52.620 --> 01:10:58.080
'Resham... Resham... Resham Resham..'

902
01:11:12.330 --> 01:11:15.500
Kanhaiya... pour me another one...

903
01:11:17.750 --> 01:11:18.800
Make another one!

904
01:11:30.620 --> 01:11:32.290
What the hell Kanhaiya!

905
01:11:33.040 --> 01:11:35.790
Worked for so long and still
haven't learned a thing?

906
01:11:36.210 --> 01:11:37.500
This is funny huh?

907
01:11:39.450 --> 01:11:41.500
Piss me off some more

908
01:11:41.500 --> 01:11:42.580
and I'll pull the doctor's entrails

909
01:11:42.580 --> 01:11:43.660
inside out right now!

910
01:11:45.910 --> 01:11:47.080
Quiet guys... quiet down!

911
01:11:47.870 --> 01:11:48.920
Everyone is asleep.

912
01:11:51.460 --> 01:11:52.790
Everyone is asleep!

913
01:11:58.410 --> 01:12:00.290
My love must be awake though eh?

914
01:12:01.410 --> 01:12:03.540
Stop talking loosely about the girl!

915
01:12:04.040 --> 01:12:05.360
She's like a daughter to me...

916
01:12:05.410 --> 01:12:06.870
Sure, like a daughter...

917
01:12:07.410 --> 01:12:08.550
Sorry father-in-law!

918
01:12:11.080 --> 01:12:12.750
That's enough! Leave now...

919
01:12:12.780 --> 01:12:14.700
I need to sleep...

920
01:12:14.710 --> 01:12:16.710
Get some more booze... this is empty...

921
01:12:17.410 --> 01:12:18.460
From where?

922
01:12:18.620 --> 01:12:19.870
From the doctor's bar...

923
01:12:22.830 --> 01:12:23.880
He got scared!

924
01:12:24.830 --> 01:12:26.080
I'll lose my job...

925
01:12:26.830 --> 01:12:28.750
I'll buy you a new bottle in the morning...

926
01:12:28.750 --> 01:12:30.000
I promise.

927
01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:31.910
Wait I'll get it.

928
01:13:27.370 --> 01:13:28.990
What the hell are you guys doing?

929
01:13:29.790 --> 01:13:30.840
Get back inside.

930
01:13:32.370 --> 01:13:33.870
Let's get back inside!

931
01:13:34.160 --> 01:13:35.210
Cheers.

932
01:13:35.280 --> 01:13:38.790
- One more drink please.
- Are you crazy?

933
01:13:38.790 --> 01:13:40.910
Just one more... Last!

934
01:13:48.500 --> 01:13:49.550
Khemu uncle?

935
01:13:49.550 --> 01:13:51.250
Stop him!

936
01:13:51.250 --> 01:13:52.300
Keep quiet!

937
01:13:55.160 --> 01:13:56.210
Papa!

938
01:13:58.290 --> 01:13:59.340
Quiet!

939
01:13:59.580 --> 01:14:00.630
Make her quiet.

940
01:14:03.660 --> 01:14:05.250
Are you mad!

941
01:14:07.000 --> 01:14:08.200
What to do?!

942
01:14:08.210 --> 01:14:09.260
Hit her!

943
01:14:19.960 --> 01:14:21.010
Kanhaiya...

944
01:14:24.330 --> 01:14:25.380
Quiet!

945
01:14:26.000 --> 01:14:27.050
Hold her down!

946
01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.500
Hit her hard with the Khukhri!

947
01:14:37.210 --> 01:14:38.260
Kanhaiya...

948
01:14:42.910 --> 01:14:43.960
Kanhaiya...

949
01:14:44.160 --> 01:14:45.780
Did you kill her with the Khukri?

950
01:14:47.210 --> 01:14:49.710
Did you murder her with the Khukri?

951
01:14:50.110 --> 01:14:52.160
Kanhaiya!

952
01:14:52.160 --> 01:14:53.200
Madam...

953
01:14:53.210 --> 01:14:54.260
Please stop!

954
01:14:59.540 --> 01:15:01.870
Call up doctor Mohanty.

955
01:15:05.780 --> 01:15:07.660
Hello...

956
01:15:07.660 --> 01:15:08.710
Hello Ashwin...

957
01:15:09.040 --> 01:15:10.090
I'm at work.

958
01:15:10.410 --> 01:15:11.960
Oh sorry, I'll call later.

959
01:15:12.540 --> 01:15:13.590
No it's ok... tell me...

960
01:15:14.040 --> 01:15:16.620
Do you remember the name

961
01:15:16.620 --> 01:15:18.500
of my migraine pills?

962
01:15:19.620 --> 01:15:22.080
The Doctor is not answering his phone...

963
01:15:24.000 --> 01:15:26.080
Relpax.

964
01:15:27.210 --> 01:15:29.750
Yes, thank you I just
couldn't remember...

965
01:15:32.160 --> 01:15:34.020
Are you watching the film 'ljaazat'?

966
01:15:36.830 --> 01:15:37.880
Yes...

967
01:15:39.250 --> 01:15:40.460
Chief!

968
01:15:41.280 --> 01:15:43.120
What happened?

969
01:15:43.120 --> 01:15:44.370
His BP has crashed.

970
01:15:47.330 --> 01:15:48.710
Give the phone to Dr.Swamy.

971
01:15:49.950 --> 01:15:51.540
Hello...

972
01:15:51.540 --> 01:15:52.660
Just a little while longer Dr.Swamy...

973
01:15:52.660 --> 01:15:53.910
We're almost there!

974
01:15:53.910 --> 01:15:55.250
- There is a problem...-

975
01:15:55.250 --> 01:15:56.580
I have to stop this!

976
01:15:56.580 --> 01:15:58.080
- It's been more than 3 hours... -

977
01:15:58.620 --> 01:16:01.570
Doctor... It will take weeks to get
permission from the court...

978
01:16:01.570 --> 01:16:02.790
- Please. -

979
01:16:02.790 --> 01:16:03.840
I'm sorry Ashwin...

980
01:16:03.840 --> 01:16:04.830
I really can't help this.

981
01:16:04.830 --> 01:16:05.970
We have to stop this now.

982
01:16:06.370 --> 01:16:07.510
This is very dangerous.

983
01:16:07.830 --> 01:16:09.460
- I'm sorry Ashwin. I can't! -

984
01:16:29.500 --> 01:16:30.550
Rajpal...

985
01:16:31.500 --> 01:16:32.870
Do you watch Rockhouse?

986
01:16:35.120 --> 01:16:36.170
Yes...

987
01:16:38.580 --> 01:16:40.500
Without fail...

988
01:16:41.210 --> 01:16:43.080
When did you see it last?

989
01:16:46.210 --> 01:16:47.910
In Khemu's room.

990
01:16:49.410 --> 01:16:51.910
Do you remember which song you saw?

991
01:16:55.540 --> 01:16:58.040
Resham... Resham... Resham...

992
01:17:10.290 --> 01:17:11.340
Rajpal...

993
01:17:12.040 --> 01:17:13.620
Why did you kill Shruti?

994
01:17:15.410 --> 01:17:17.330
Shruti - why did you kill her?

995
01:17:20.710 --> 01:17:22.710
I... I didn't kill Shruti...

996
01:17:23.080 --> 01:17:24.130
Then?

997
01:17:24.620 --> 01:17:27.710
In fact I loved her very much...

998
01:17:31.370 --> 01:17:34.330
Everything went wrong...

999
01:17:34.330 --> 01:17:37.580
on that drunken night.

1000
01:17:37.580 --> 01:17:38.630
What went wrong?

1001
01:17:40.210 --> 01:17:42.210
Kanhaiya was the one responsible...

1002
01:17:43.040 --> 01:17:44.090
Kanhaiya?

1003
01:17:45.290 --> 01:17:47.460
Ask Bhakbhakaun...

1004
01:17:49.540 --> 01:17:51.080
Bak... who?

1005
01:17:52.160 --> 01:17:53.370
Bhak... Bhakbakau...

1006
01:17:54.540 --> 01:17:56.410
He was there too...

1007
01:18:00.790 --> 01:18:02.660
Who is this Bhakbhakaun?

1008
01:18:03.210 --> 01:18:06.330
Bhak.. bakau...

1009
01:18:11.580 --> 01:18:13.260
What the hell have you guys done?!

1010
01:18:13.830 --> 01:18:15.710
Nothing happened! Don't worry!

1011
01:18:16.410 --> 01:18:18.500
Look... look...

1012
01:18:20.370 --> 01:18:21.420
She's breathing...

1013
01:18:21.830 --> 01:18:23.120
she's still breathing...

1014
01:18:24.210 --> 01:18:25.770
She just got scared and fainted.

1015
01:18:26.080 --> 01:18:27.370
Everything will be okay...

1016
01:18:27.790 --> 01:18:29.330
Hey Bhakbhakaun!

1017
01:18:37.070 --> 01:18:42.250
I'll wake everyone up and
tell them what happened!

1018
01:18:42.250 --> 01:18:44.620
Are you crazy?
We'll all be behind bars!

1019
01:18:45.660 --> 01:18:48.790
Let's go to the terrace
and think clearly...

1020
01:18:49.410 --> 01:18:50.460
You're our brother...

1021
01:18:51.040 --> 01:18:54.330
we'll do whatever you say...

1022
01:18:55.500 --> 01:18:56.550
Come on!

1023
01:19:05.540 --> 01:19:07.210
If you want to run away then run!

1024
01:19:07.910 --> 01:19:10.290
I'm going to tell Sir everything!

1025
01:19:10.290 --> 01:19:12.580
I don't care if I go to jail
or get hanged!

1026
01:19:14.160 --> 01:19:15.210
Khemu listen!

1027
01:19:15.910 --> 01:19:17.170
My uncle is a cop back home...

1028
01:19:17.870 --> 01:19:19.500
Once we cross the border

1029
01:19:19.830 --> 01:19:21.160
no one will catch us!

1030
01:19:21.410 --> 01:19:23.290
You met him at the wedding, remember?

1031
01:21:44.210 --> 01:21:45.540
Who is this Bhakbhakaun?

1032
01:21:47.790 --> 01:21:48.840
No idea Sir...

1033
01:21:53.040 --> 01:21:54.870
Become a witness and you'll be saved...

1034
01:21:56.790 --> 01:21:57.870
It's all a lie Sir...

1035
01:21:58.790 --> 01:21:59.930
- I didn't do anything. -

1036
01:22:00.660 --> 01:22:02.290
You shot me up with drugs and

1037
01:22:02.290 --> 01:22:04.280
made me say whatever
you wanted to hear...

1038
01:22:11.750 --> 01:22:13.660
And made you sing too?

1039
01:22:17.790 --> 01:22:22.410
Resham... Resham... Resham...

1040
01:22:42.030 --> 01:22:43.870
Want to see a film?

1041
01:22:43.870 --> 01:22:45.540
You said some interesting things in it.

1042
01:22:45.540 --> 01:22:49.290
My lawyer says your film
cannot play in court.

1043
01:22:49.290 --> 01:22:51.200


1044
01:22:51.210 --> 01:22:52.260
What did you say?

1045
01:22:52.370 --> 01:22:53.420
What does that mean?

1046
01:22:53.790 --> 01:22:54.930
He sang the song right?

1047
01:22:55.540 --> 01:22:56.590
So ask him.

1048
01:22:57.580 --> 01:22:59.460
Don't touch me!

1049
01:22:59.790 --> 01:23:01.960
Hey Vedant wait...

1050
01:23:02.830 --> 01:23:03.880
No... no... don't...

1051
01:23:04.830 --> 01:23:05.880
Don't touch me!

1052
01:23:06.710 --> 01:23:07.760
Stop-".

1053
01:23:09.540 --> 01:23:11.580
If our Welfare Group gets to know,

1054
01:23:11.580 --> 01:23:12.630
they won't spare you...

1055
01:23:21.660 --> 01:23:24.290
It doesn't matter if the film
plays in court or not...

1056
01:23:27.000 --> 01:23:28.540
But your 'The End' is certain.

1057
01:23:33.580 --> 01:23:36.040
Chief! The TV channel has confirmed...

1058
01:23:36.790 --> 01:23:38.290
that song was telecast

1059
01:23:38.290 --> 01:23:40.210
on their Rockhouse program that night.

1060
01:23:47.000 --> 01:23:48.680
Who the heck is this Bhakbhakaun?

1061
01:23:52.410 --> 01:23:54.330
Call all of them again for questioning.

1062
01:24:03.280 --> 01:24:05.370
Sir.

1063
01:24:05.370 --> 01:24:06.660
Congratulations!

1064
01:24:07.660 --> 01:24:08.910
The blood found

1065
01:24:08.910 --> 01:24:10.620
on Kanhaiya's pillow cover...

1066
01:24:12.080 --> 01:24:13.790
it matches with Khempal's blood!

1067
01:24:14.580 --> 01:24:16.690
- Great!
- They are sending a formal report.

1068
01:24:16.790 --> 01:24:18.500
Congrats indeed!

1069
01:24:22.290 --> 01:24:24.250
This is my boy!

1070
01:24:24.250 --> 01:24:25.460
My Bond! - Yes...

1071
01:24:26.960 --> 01:24:28.830
I'm your boy... You're happy Sir!

1072
01:24:28.830 --> 01:24:29.880
We'll miss you...

1073
01:24:30.960 --> 01:24:32.330
I'll miss you...

1074
01:24:34.330 --> 01:24:35.460
I'll just come...

1075
01:24:38.290 --> 01:24:40.150
So who's going to take over after you?

1076
01:24:40.620 --> 01:24:41.670
JK!

1077
01:24:46.960 --> 01:24:49.370
This guy will take over...

1078
01:24:49.370 --> 01:24:52.460
But he'll never overtake me.

1079
01:24:53.710 --> 01:24:54.760
Rama...

1080
01:24:55.250 --> 01:24:56.540
you'll never change!

1081
01:24:57.040 --> 01:24:58.090
And you?

1082
01:24:58.710 --> 01:25:00.080
Will keep changing!

1083
01:25:00.080 --> 01:25:01.130
Like a chameleon!

1084
01:25:03.160 --> 01:25:04.370
Sometimes red...

1085
01:25:05.160 --> 01:25:06.450
sometimes yellow...

1086
01:25:06.460 --> 01:25:07.510
sometimes blue...

1087
01:25:09.040 --> 01:25:13.080
May I request the outgoing director
to come up here on stage.

1088
01:25:13.790 --> 01:25:17.160
- Come on, let's make you green now.
- Green?

1089
01:25:17.870 --> 01:25:20.790
The jealous green!

1090
01:25:21.960 --> 01:25:23.010
Excuse us.

1091
01:25:39.660 --> 01:25:42.580
My heart is heavy,

1092
01:25:44.960 --> 01:25:46.460
and simultaneously light too...

1093
01:25:47.500 --> 01:25:48.750
Heavy because...

1094
01:25:49.790 --> 01:25:51.830
I can't be with you anymore...

1095
01:25:54.210 --> 01:25:55.260
Light

1096
01:25:55.710 --> 01:25:58.000
because I don't need to
deal with you anymore...

1097
01:26:00.330 --> 01:26:01.380
No more!

1098
01:26:04.290 --> 01:26:05.830
For forty years...

1099
01:26:06.870 --> 01:26:07.920
I have...

1100
01:26:08.750 --> 01:26:10.410
just one word to give you...

1101
01:26:12.000 --> 01:26:13.210
Thank you!

1102
01:26:17.290 --> 01:26:19.710
And for my good friend,

1103
01:26:20.410 --> 01:26:23.000
your new Director...

1104
01:26:23.910 --> 01:26:26.290
a Parting gift!

1105
01:26:28.080 --> 01:26:29.290
Ladies and gentlemen...

1106
01:26:30.410 --> 01:26:32.030
During the tenure of yours truly...

1107
01:26:32.870 --> 01:26:35.040
the double murder case...

1108
01:26:36.040 --> 01:26:37.210
has been solved!

1109
01:26:44.460 --> 01:26:45.510
Well done!

1110
01:26:51.080 --> 01:26:53.160
Hit her hard with the Khukri.

1111
01:26:57.410 --> 01:26:58.750
Khempal called the cops?

1112
01:26:59.660 --> 01:27:05.120
We killed him before
he had the chance.

1113
01:27:06.330 --> 01:27:08.210
How did you kill Khempal?

1114
01:27:10.830 --> 01:27:12.330
With the Khukri.

1115
01:27:23.500 --> 01:27:24.550
Well...

1116
01:27:25.500 --> 01:27:26.960
This is all very good, Ashwin.

1117
01:27:26.960 --> 01:27:28.040
- Congrats! -

1118
01:27:28.040 --> 01:27:29.090
Thank you Sir.

1119
01:27:29.090 --> 01:27:31.830
What is the main evidence
on the chargesheet?

1120
01:27:31.830 --> 01:27:32.870
We recovered...

1121
01:27:32.870 --> 01:27:33.920
Sir...

1122
01:27:33.920 --> 01:27:35.580
Sorry.

1123
01:27:35.580 --> 01:27:37.830
The blood found on
Kanhaiya's pillow cover...

1124
01:27:37.830 --> 01:27:39.790
matches Khempal's blood.

1125
01:27:45.160 --> 01:27:48.460
So if this is our main evidence...

1126
01:27:48.460 --> 01:27:51.000
don't you think we should get this

1127
01:27:51.000 --> 01:27:52.250
reconfirmed by the lab?

1128
01:27:53.620 --> 01:27:54.670
Why sir?

1129
01:27:54.960 --> 01:27:58.830
Narco tests are not admissible in court

1130
01:27:58.830 --> 01:28:00.760
and I want to be
doubly sure about this.

1131
01:28:01.710 --> 01:28:04.580
Vedant, take the first flight
to Ahmedabad,

1132
01:28:04.580 --> 01:28:06.330
and submit the reconfirmation

1133
01:28:06.330 --> 01:28:07.530
of the report by evening.

1134
01:28:07.660 --> 01:28:08.710
You understand?

1135
01:28:14.960 --> 01:28:16.010
Ashwin...

1136
01:28:16.010 --> 01:28:17.250
Yes Sir...

1137
01:28:17.250 --> 01:28:19.660
You can file the chargesheet
day after tomorrow.

1138
01:28:19.660 --> 01:28:20.870
- Happy?
- Thank you Sir.

1139
01:28:24.290 --> 01:28:25.340
Sir...

1140
01:28:25.340 --> 01:28:27.540
Sir... tomorrow is my
fiancée's birthday...

1141
01:28:27.540 --> 01:28:28.590
Take her with you.

1142
01:28:29.120 --> 01:28:30.170
Sir tomorrow we...

1143
01:28:30.500 --> 01:28:32.370
When is your promotion due?

1144
01:28:33.160 --> 01:28:34.210
Still time for that...

1145
01:28:35.290 --> 01:28:37.250
There's never enough time, Vedant.

1146
01:28:37.250 --> 01:28:38.300
All the best!

1147
01:28:43.410 --> 01:28:46.660
On the recommendation of
Central Department of Investigation

1148
01:28:47.410 --> 01:28:50.500
this court grants bail
to Dr. Ramesh Tandon

1149
01:28:50.500 --> 01:28:52.670
with the following
terms and conditions:

1150
01:28:53.460 --> 01:28:55.830
The applicant is to furnish
a bond of Rs. 5 lakhs

1151
01:28:57.000 --> 01:28:58.740
and securities of a similar amount.

1152
01:29:02.910 --> 01:29:03.960
Yes Sir...

1153
01:29:05.160 --> 01:29:06.240
Ashwin listen to this...

1154
01:29:06.320 --> 01:29:08.370
Yes Vedant, carry on...

1155
01:29:08.370 --> 01:29:09.790
Sir I don't know how these idiots

1156
01:29:09.790 --> 01:29:11.330
could make such a huge mistake!

1157
01:29:11.330 --> 01:29:13.680
- They say there's some
typographical error... -

1158
01:29:13.910 --> 01:29:15.290
What typographical error?

1159
01:29:15.290 --> 01:29:16.750
Forensics collected pillow covers

1160
01:29:16.750 --> 01:29:19.370
from Khempal and Kanhaiya's rooms.

1161
01:29:19.370 --> 01:29:20.330
- Right?

1162
01:29:20.330 --> 01:29:21.160
Right...

1163
01:29:21.160 --> 01:29:23.410
They named Khempal's cover as Z-25

1164
01:29:23.750 --> 01:29:25.870
and Kanhaiya's as X-52.

1165
01:29:26.250 --> 01:29:27.700
Now they're saying

1166
01:29:27.710 --> 01:29:29.410
they've typed 2-25 as X-52

1167
01:29:29.410 --> 01:29:30.610
in the report by mistake.

1168
01:29:30.660 --> 01:29:32.040
It's a typographical error.

1169
01:29:32.250 --> 01:29:33.410
Which now means that

1170
01:29:33.410 --> 01:29:34.580
the pillow cover with Khempal's blood

1171
01:29:34.580 --> 01:29:35.870
was found in Khempal's room

1172
01:29:35.870 --> 01:29:37.250
and not Kanhaiya's?

1173
01:29:37.250 --> 01:29:37.790
Is that it?

1174
01:29:37.790 --> 01:29:39.250
That's exactly what they're saying Sir!

1175
01:29:39.250 --> 01:29:40.160
How can they say that?

1176
01:29:40.160 --> 01:29:42.580
I collected the bloodied
pillow cover myself

1177
01:29:42.580 --> 01:29:43.700
from Kanhaiya's room!

1178
01:29:43.710 --> 01:29:44.790
How's that possible?

1179
01:29:44.790 --> 01:29:46.160
And how can anyone

1180
01:29:46.160 --> 01:29:48.000
mistakenly type Z-25 as X-52

1181
01:29:48.000 --> 01:29:49.580
ten different times
in the same report?

1182
01:29:49.580 --> 01:29:51.000
I've been trying to tell them

1183
01:29:51.000 --> 01:29:53.200
the same thing for hours.

1184
01:29:53.210 --> 01:29:54.290
But they are adamant!

1185
01:29:54.290 --> 01:29:55.500
Who's in charge there?

1186
01:29:55.500 --> 01:29:56.330
Put me through to him...

1187
01:29:56.330 --> 01:29:57.530
I'll kill that b******!

1188
01:29:57.710 --> 01:29:59.810
I will handle this officially don't worry.

1189
01:29:59.810 --> 01:30:00.950
No no Sir... Let me...

1190
01:30:00.960 --> 01:30:03.080
Vedant, scan and mail me
those reports immediately!

1191
01:30:03.080 --> 01:30:04.130
Hello... Listen...

1192
01:30:04.210 --> 01:30:05.660
I will go myself... to Ahmedabad.

1193
01:30:05.660 --> 01:30:07.080
No no... you don't have to go...

1194
01:30:07.080 --> 01:30:07.950
I will handle it...

1195
01:30:07.960 --> 01:30:09.010
And trust me...

1196
01:30:11.410 --> 01:30:12.670
But how is that possible?

1197
01:30:21.790 --> 01:30:24.080
<i>- Are the Memos done'?
- Yes.</i>

1198
01:30:24.540 --> 01:30:26.080
Turn off the gas.

1199
01:30:28.290 --> 01:30:30.870
Bhabhakaun... Hey Bhabhakaun!

1200
01:30:31.870 --> 01:30:32.960
Bhabhakaun!

1201
01:30:33.790 --> 01:30:34.870
Bhabhakaun!

1202
01:30:36.210 --> 01:30:38.120
Where has this Bhabhakaun gone?

1203
01:30:38.120 --> 01:30:40.370
What did you just say?
What is this Bhabhakaun?

1204
01:30:40.370 --> 01:30:43.620
In Nepalese, stutterers
are called Bhabhakaun.

1205
01:30:43.620 --> 01:30:44.700
Where is Bhabhakaun?

1206
01:30:44.710 --> 01:30:45.760
- Here he is. -

1207
01:30:45.870 --> 01:30:46.920
- Where were you? -

1208
01:30:47.290 --> 01:30:48.670
I had g.. gone to the b.. bathroom.

1209
01:31:01.080 --> 01:31:02.130
Who is it?

1210
01:31:12.120 --> 01:31:13.170
What were you doing?

1211
01:31:15.330 --> 01:31:17.870
S..s... sleeping...

1212
01:31:18.750 --> 01:31:21.000
Bhak.. bhak.. bhakaun?

1213
01:31:59.660 --> 01:32:01.040
Why did <i>I</i> hit you?

1214
01:32:05.000 --> 01:32:06.050
I... I don't know...

1215
01:32:06.160 --> 01:32:08.960
You'll speak the truth, yes?

1216
01:32:10.500 --> 01:32:12.080
Yes Sir...

1217
01:32:13.250 --> 01:32:14.330
The truth...

1218
01:32:14.750 --> 01:32:15.800
Yes...

1219
01:32:16.210 --> 01:32:18.330
You'll testify in court?

1220
01:32:22.500 --> 01:32:24.460
Will they hang me?

1221
01:32:26.290 --> 01:32:27.910
No, they will probably let you go...

1222
01:32:28.160 --> 01:32:29.460
if you tell them the truth.

1223
01:32:30.710 --> 01:32:31.760
Alright?

1224
01:32:32.790 --> 01:32:34.500
Y.. yes Sir...

1225
01:32:36.210 --> 01:32:37.290
Shoot him!

1226
01:32:38.410 --> 01:32:42.000
No.. no Sir please don't shoot me!

1227
01:32:45.210 --> 01:32:48.660
We'll shoot you with a
camera, is that okay?

1228
01:32:52.790 --> 01:32:54.540
Y.. yes sir...

1229
01:32:59.790 --> 01:33:00.840
Sir...

1230
01:33:03.710 --> 01:33:10.660
I... I slept early that night...

1231
01:33:15.160 --> 01:33:16.710
Khempal came to wake me up...

1232
01:33:17.080 --> 01:33:19.250
Nandu wake up! Wake up!

1233
01:33:21.830 --> 01:33:23.450
What the hell have you guys done?

1234
01:33:24.000 --> 01:33:25.910
Nothing's happened!

1235
01:33:25.910 --> 01:33:27.620
Don't worry... look!

1236
01:33:30.410 --> 01:33:31.460
She's breathing...

1237
01:33:31.790 --> 01:33:33.040
she's still breathing...

1238
01:33:34.750 --> 01:33:36.750
She's just unconscious...

1239
01:33:37.960 --> 01:33:39.540
Listen to me!

1240
01:33:39.910 --> 01:33:42.410
When I reached there...

1241
01:33:43.500 --> 01:33:44.830
Bhakbhakaun!

1242
01:33:45.290 --> 01:33:51.000
By.. by then they had killed Sh...
Shruti...

1243
01:33:52.620 --> 01:33:53.670
- They who? -

1244
01:33:58.410 --> 01:34:00.580
K.K.. Kanhaiya and Rajpal.

1245
01:34:01.830 --> 01:34:03.870
You'll testify in court of your own will?

1246
01:34:09.500 --> 01:34:10.550
Yes Sir...

1247
01:34:15.580 --> 01:34:16.910
You think I'm a fool?

1248
01:34:18.000 --> 01:34:19.050
What? Sorry?

1249
01:34:19.050 --> 01:34:21.540
First you beat up
and torture somebody,

1250
01:34:21.540 --> 01:34:23.410
then force him to
become an approver?!

1251
01:34:23.410 --> 01:34:25.000
Sir he's ready to testify in
the magistrate's presence!

1252
01:34:25.000 --> 01:34:26.500
Then we chargesheet
and the case is over!

1253
01:34:26.500 --> 01:34:28.490
I don't know how Rama
used to run things...

1254
01:34:28.490 --> 01:34:30.120
but this will not
happen in my command!

1255
01:34:30.120 --> 01:34:31.620
Sir he's willing to testify on his own!

1256
01:34:31.620 --> 01:34:33.480
You guys have turned this into a joke!

1257
01:34:33.480 --> 01:34:36.870
With great difficulty this agency
has built a reputation!

1258
01:34:36.870 --> 01:34:38.070
I won't let it go to dogs!

1259
01:34:38.070 --> 01:34:40.750
I will not tolerate this anymore!

1260
01:34:40.750 --> 01:34:41.800
Look at this!

1261
01:34:42.420 --> 01:34:45.160
- Look at this!
- What is this?

1262
01:34:45.160 --> 01:34:46.250
Look at it!

1263
01:34:55.500 --> 01:34:57.720
You're off this case with immediate effect!

1264
01:34:57.720 --> 01:34:59.000
Sir...

1265
01:34:59.000 --> 01:34:59.830
Enough!

1266
01:34:59.830 --> 01:35:00.700
I don't want any more words.

1267
01:35:00.710 --> 01:35:01.370
This is..

1268
01:35:01.370 --> 01:35:02.420
Finished!

1269
01:35:05.580 --> 01:35:06.630
Traitor!

1270
01:35:08.370 --> 01:35:09.420
Ashwin!

1271
01:35:13.540 --> 01:35:15.040
You can't do this Ashwin!

1272
01:35:15.040 --> 01:35:16.540
Vinod! Come in!

1273
01:35:19.830 --> 01:35:21.540
Take him away!

1274
01:35:23.870 --> 01:35:25.010
Take this psycho away!

1275
01:35:25.660 --> 01:35:29.040
- This is wrong!
- Get out!

1276
01:35:30.540 --> 01:35:31.920
You're suspended! Get out!

1277
01:36:29.750 --> 01:36:30.800
Who is it Vaishali?

1278
01:36:53.370 --> 01:36:55.460
I can't do it...

1279
01:36:56.290 --> 01:36:57.340
What?

1280
01:36:58.540 --> 01:37:00.080
I can't do it anymore...

1281
01:37:03.660 --> 01:37:04.710
Do what?

1282
01:37:05.370 --> 01:37:06.870
I just can't.

1283
01:37:14.210 --> 01:37:16.790
Please don't let me go...

1284
01:37:17.460 --> 01:37:18.510
Please...

1285
01:37:18.580 --> 01:37:19.630
- Where? -

1286
01:37:20.710 --> 01:37:22.120
I can't go back to my job!

1287
01:37:37.290 --> 01:37:40.790
The CDI has failed to file
a chargesheet within 90 days.

1288
01:37:40.960 --> 01:37:43.080
And the court has released the accused

1289
01:37:43.080 --> 01:37:45.460
in the Shruti murder case, on bail.

1290
01:37:45.750 --> 01:37:48.160
Sources say the CDI will now start

1291
01:37:48.160 --> 01:37:50.460
a new investigation with a new team.

1292
01:37:59.580 --> 01:38:03.200
I'm sure all of you have
heard a lot of stories

1293
01:38:03.210 --> 01:38:05.200
about the Shruti murder case

1294
01:38:05.210 --> 01:38:06.350
as well as Ashwin Kumar.

1295
01:38:07.080 --> 01:38:11.830
So it's important that
all doubts be cleared.

1296
01:38:14.960 --> 01:38:19.660
I think... he got too emotionally
involved with the case.

1297
01:38:20.500 --> 01:38:22.870
The way doctors remain

1298
01:38:22.870 --> 01:38:25.410
emotionally detached from their patients...

1299
01:38:26.040 --> 01:38:29.910
We too, need to keep
some emotional distance

1300
01:38:29.910 --> 01:38:33.830
from our cases and subjects.

1301
01:38:35.040 --> 01:38:36.120
So I request all of you...

1302
01:38:37.080 --> 01:38:41.540
please... do not, like Ashwin

1303
01:38:41.960 --> 01:38:43.330
let your personal lives

1304
01:38:43.330 --> 01:38:45.660
get in the way
of your investigation.

1305
01:38:46.960 --> 01:38:48.010
Any questions?

1306
01:38:49.870 --> 01:38:52.000
Good, so let's get
back to work gentlemen.

1307
01:38:52.620 --> 01:38:53.670
Thank you.

1308
01:38:55.500 --> 01:38:56.960
- Sir, a small request.
- Yes?

1309
01:38:56.960 --> 01:39:01.080
Could we assign an
investigative officer to the case?

1310
01:39:01.080 --> 01:39:02.130
Why?

1311
01:39:02.130 --> 01:39:04.290
Sir, I've been involved with the case

1312
01:39:04.290 --> 01:39:06.150
along with Ashwin from the beginning...

1313
01:39:06.290 --> 01:39:07.430
No matter how hard I try...

1314
01:39:07.830 --> 01:39:10.300
I won't get an objective
perspective on the case...

1315
01:39:11.000 --> 01:39:12.050
It would be better if...

1316
01:39:12.120 --> 01:39:14.220
an investigative office
works on the case...

1317
01:39:14.370 --> 01:39:15.810
and I observe from a distance.

1318
01:39:16.710 --> 01:39:18.090
Do you have anybody in mind?

1319
01:39:18.960 --> 01:39:20.280
Manohar or Bhattacharya?

1320
01:39:23.620 --> 01:39:25.120
No, they have their hands full...

1321
01:39:26.790 --> 01:39:27.840
Paul Sir?

1322
01:39:32.290 --> 01:39:33.660
How long will you hide?

1323
01:39:36.330 --> 01:39:37.830
How far will you run?

1324
01:39:39.210 --> 01:39:41.330
I've caught most wanted criminals...

1325
01:39:41.750 --> 01:39:43.120
You too cannot escape!

1326
01:39:45.750 --> 01:39:47.610
Come out, come out, wherever you are!

1327
01:39:50.120 --> 01:39:51.170
What's this?

1328
01:39:52.040 --> 01:39:53.240
He's become invisible!

1329
01:39:53.750 --> 01:39:54.800
You scoundrel!

1330
01:39:55.210 --> 01:39:56.260
Come out, rogue!

1331
01:39:57.160 --> 01:40:00.620
Give yourself up while you still can!

1332
01:40:03.080 --> 01:40:04.130
Hello? ..

1333
01:40:04.620 --> 01:40:05.670
- Good evening, Sir...-

1334
01:40:06.790 --> 01:40:08.410
Sir, I'm on leave for two months...

1335
01:40:09.660 --> 01:40:11.620
The wife has gone to her parents...

1336
01:40:11.620 --> 01:40:13.000
Yes...

1337
01:40:13.000 --> 01:40:14.050
Gotcha!

1338
01:40:16.870 --> 01:40:19.580
I'll just need a couple of days
to go through the files...

1339
01:40:19.960 --> 01:40:23.120
It's an honor that you have
considered me for this case Sir!

1340
01:40:24.500 --> 01:40:25.550
What about Kuku?

1341
01:40:27.540 --> 01:40:28.710
He'll be with me...

1342
01:40:30.290 --> 01:40:31.750
but there's no problem Sir...

1343
01:40:33.160 --> 01:40:34.830
A kid hanging around

1344
01:40:35.000 --> 01:40:36.620
a murder investigation Mr. Paul?

1345
01:40:38.000 --> 01:40:42.370
Sir, there's no one to take care
of him after school...

1346
01:40:42.370 --> 01:40:45.450
The Department can arrange
a babysitter for you...

1347
01:40:45.460 --> 01:40:47.120
No, it's not that...

1348
01:40:48.540 --> 01:40:51.330
The thing is, he is not an
easily manageable child...

1349
01:40:52.540 --> 01:40:54.280
and actually, he is not even a child...

1350
01:40:54.500 --> 01:40:55.550
Not a child?

1351
01:40:58.290 --> 01:40:59.960
He's a demon!

1352
01:41:03.410 --> 01:41:04.460
Sir...

1353
01:41:06.000 --> 01:41:07.050
Sir, I need a demon...

1354
01:41:07.540 --> 01:41:08.590
I mean a prosecutor...

1355
01:41:08.830 --> 01:41:10.330
in the team from the beginning.

1356
01:41:10.830 --> 01:41:12.410
Prosecutor? Why?

1357
01:41:13.040 --> 01:41:15.000
To minutely verify all evidence

1358
01:41:15.160 --> 01:41:16.460
is very imperative.

1359
01:41:17.040 --> 01:41:18.090
Everyday.

1360
01:41:19.210 --> 01:41:21.210
Mr. Sanga! We're together again!

1361
01:41:22.290 --> 01:41:24.390
We don't want to repeat
Ashwin's mistakes...

1362
01:41:25.750 --> 01:41:28.710
No matter how diligently we
investigate the case...

1363
01:41:28.910 --> 01:41:30.830
ultimately, it is the prosecutor

1364
01:41:31.000 --> 01:41:32.990
who has to prove it
and win a conviction.

1365
01:41:33.960 --> 01:41:35.500
Evidence and conviction

1366
01:41:36.080 --> 01:41:37.400
are like mother and infant.

1367
01:41:38.870 --> 01:41:41.040
A healthy mother ensures
a healthy infant.

1368
01:41:49.290 --> 01:41:54.330
You made a statement that Rajpal
was with you till 12:30 at night?

1369
01:41:56.210 --> 01:41:58.790
Yes. I was returning from Dehradun...

1370
01:41:59.000 --> 01:42:02.040
Mr. Nathani and Rajpal
picked me up from the station.

1371
01:42:02.960 --> 01:42:04.040
I was fasting that day...

1372
01:42:04.710 --> 01:42:06.790
so I had dinner at 12:00

1373
01:42:06.960 --> 01:42:09.960
and went to bed at around 12:30 am.

1374
01:42:12.330 --> 01:42:15.910
How long does it take to reach
Dr.Tandon's house from here?

1375
01:42:18.290 --> 01:42:19.620
40 minutes at the most.

1376
01:42:21.290 --> 01:42:22.340
On foot?

1377
01:42:22.750 --> 01:42:23.800
Yes.

1378
01:42:24.750 --> 01:42:25.800
And by cycle?

1379
01:42:27.960 --> 01:42:29.010
20 minutes.

1380
01:42:30.160 --> 01:42:31.210
Okay-

1381
01:42:32.960 --> 01:42:34.220
I'm telling the truth Sir...

1382
01:42:34.790 --> 01:42:38.040
that day Kanhaiya came
straight home from work.

1383
01:42:38.910 --> 01:42:41.620
Six of us sleep here...

1384
01:42:41.790 --> 01:42:44.620
so if he had gone out
and come in,

1385
01:42:44.790 --> 01:42:46.660
someone would have woken up.

1386
01:42:48.000 --> 01:42:49.050
Okay-

1387
01:42:50.660 --> 01:42:52.500
Are you for real?

1388
01:42:53.040 --> 01:42:56.580
I saw alcohol bottles
in Khempal's room.

1389
01:42:57.620 --> 01:42:58.940
And the cot was depressed?

1390
01:42:59.040 --> 01:43:00.120
Yes.

1391
01:43:00.960 --> 01:43:02.370
- And you?
- What?

1392
01:43:03.290 --> 01:43:05.040
How much pressure did you face?

1393
01:43:06.540 --> 01:43:09.370
2 lakhs? 5 lakhs?

1394
01:43:09.830 --> 01:43:10.880
Kanhaiya!

1395
01:43:11.370 --> 01:43:12.420
Kanhaiya!

1396
01:43:12.540 --> 01:43:16.910
Did you kill her with a Khukri?

1397
01:43:18.290 --> 01:43:20.700
Was he saying this or
were you making him say it?

1398
01:43:21.040 --> 01:43:24.160
Mind your tongue Mr.Paul!

1399
01:43:24.460 --> 01:43:27.120
You're talking to a
retired police officer!

1400
01:43:27.710 --> 01:43:30.210
When we get a lead we have to prod...

1401
01:43:30.370 --> 01:43:31.930
There's nothing wrong in this!

1402
01:43:32.710 --> 01:43:34.690
It's not wrong, it's completely wrong!

1403
01:43:34.960 --> 01:43:36.010
And unethical!

1404
01:43:36.290 --> 01:43:39.180
Need permission to conduct
Narco test on the parents Sir.

1405
01:43:42.290 --> 01:43:44.640
Ramesh, did you enter
Shruti's room at night?

1406
01:43:45.040 --> 01:43:47.830
Did you tidy up the
sheets after the murder?

1407
01:43:48.460 --> 01:43:50.120
How did you kill Shruti, Ramesh?

1408
01:43:51.040 --> 01:43:52.870
Did you clean the room afterwards?

1409
01:43:53.290 --> 01:43:58.120
Sources say the CDI
has been left red-faced.

1410
01:43:58.750 --> 01:44:00.910
As per the Narco tests

1411
01:44:01.290 --> 01:44:02.750
the CDI has found no evidence

1412
01:44:03.040 --> 01:44:05.620
that connects the Tandon's
to Shruti's murder.

1413
01:44:06.540 --> 01:44:09.830
Both the husband and wife
are clever scoundrels!

1414
01:44:10.540 --> 01:44:13.430
They must've taken some
antidote before the Narco tests...

1415
01:44:13.790 --> 01:44:16.330
No wonder the Narco drugs
didn't work on them.

1416
01:44:19.500 --> 01:44:21.430
Are there antidotes
for Narco tests?

1417
01:44:21.660 --> 01:44:23.960
There aren't. But there could be...

1418
01:44:25.120 --> 01:44:27.540
Don't forget... they're both Doctors!

1419
01:44:29.460 --> 01:44:31.870
The ones testing them
are also Doctors, Mr. Paul...

1420
01:44:31.870 --> 01:44:33.250
I'm sure they were put through

1421
01:44:33.250 --> 01:44:35.120
blood tests before the Narco.

1422
01:44:35.410 --> 01:44:38.120
It could also be possible that

1423
01:44:38.120 --> 01:44:40.220
they didn't commit the murders after all?

1424
01:44:42.660 --> 01:44:45.500
Look at their faces... their eyes...

1425
01:44:45.660 --> 01:44:47.540
Don't they look like murderers?

1426
01:45:09.910 --> 01:45:12.120
But there are two of them in the photo.

1427
01:45:13.290 --> 01:45:14.790
It's been one and a half years...

1428
01:45:17.410 --> 01:45:18.910
I have no idea where it could be.

1429
01:45:20.120 --> 01:45:23.160
The girl's forehead wound
is 4x3 centimeters.

1430
01:45:25.120 --> 01:45:27.120
And how big is this?

1431
01:45:31.850 --> 01:45:35.500
Khempal was hit on the back of the head...

1432
01:45:35.500 --> 01:45:36.940
and the girl on the forehead?

1433
01:45:41.870 --> 01:45:43.000
God is great!

1434
01:45:44.620 --> 01:45:46.730
And holy are the
messengers of his faith!

1435
01:45:49.120 --> 01:45:50.170
Missionary.

1436
01:45:50.910 --> 01:45:52.590
What the hell are you making me do?

1437
01:46:52.370 --> 01:46:55.540
You are bargaining like
you're out to buy vegetables...

1438
01:46:55.540 --> 01:46:56.950
- No Gogia Sir... Nothing like that. -

1439
01:46:56.960 --> 01:46:58.580
This is not how business is done...

1440
01:46:58.580 --> 01:47:00.750
- Please see what you can do.
- This will be very difficult for me.-

1441
01:47:00.750 --> 01:47:02.830
This is what it is... Now you decide.

1442
01:47:32.000 --> 01:47:33.160
Thank you.

1443
01:47:55.710 --> 01:47:56.830
In some cases...

1444
01:47:57.410 --> 01:48:01.250
the process of intelligence gathering
has to trample law...

1445
01:48:03.040 --> 01:48:06.160
in order to achieve effective results.

1446
01:48:07.790 --> 01:48:11.620
That's why some experts
define information gathering...

1447
01:48:12.830 --> 01:48:15.210
as a legal act carried out illegally.

1448
01:48:21.040 --> 01:48:23.270
Somewhere we have to
find a balance between...

1449
01:48:25.290 --> 01:48:26.790
what the system wants you to do...

1450
01:48:28.750 --> 01:48:31.500
and what you feel is
right as an individual.

1451
01:48:36.620 --> 01:48:37.670
Thank you.

1452
01:48:43.250 --> 01:48:45.210
Time for the Q and A.

1453
01:48:45.370 --> 01:48:48.200
If anyone has any questions
for Mr. Kumar please proceed.

1454
01:48:49.580 --> 01:48:50.630
Yeah, Sandeep...

1455
01:48:52.460 --> 01:48:53.510
Sir, I was wondering...

1456
01:48:54.250 --> 01:48:57.200
since you're such an accomplished
officer of your agency...

1457
01:48:57.460 --> 01:48:59.440
Why did you take premature retirement?

1458
01:49:01.000 --> 01:49:02.050
What made you quit?

1459
01:49:04.040 --> 01:49:05.780
I guess I couldn't find the balance.

1460
01:49:08.370 --> 01:49:10.180
Call me if any one
of you guys find it.

1461
01:49:11.120 --> 01:49:12.170
Please...

1462
01:49:12.660 --> 01:49:14.000
- Thank you Sir.-

1463
01:49:19.710 --> 01:49:22.060
Sir, are you sure
you dialed the right number?

1464
01:49:23.410 --> 01:49:24.460
Ashwin, how are you?

1465
01:49:25.040 --> 01:49:26.090
All well...

1466
01:49:27.040 --> 01:49:30.000
The meeting I spoke to you about earlier...
- Yes... -

1467
01:49:30.160 --> 01:49:31.580
It's at 11:00 am tomorrow.

1468
01:49:34.620 --> 01:49:39.040
Many of your fans will be present...

1469
01:49:40.790 --> 01:49:42.290
- Alright?
- Okay,

1470
01:49:46.040 --> 01:49:48.830
I've read the reports
from both teams, in detail...

1471
01:49:49.830 --> 01:49:52.120
Both the conclusions are as different

1472
01:49:52.120 --> 01:49:53.830
as warring political parties!

1473
01:49:56.410 --> 01:49:58.830
One team says the
servants are the killers,

1474
01:49:58.830 --> 01:50:01.290
and the other says the parents did it.

1475
01:50:01.830 --> 01:50:03.820
Now the ministry has
to take some stand...

1476
01:50:04.540 --> 01:50:05.590
- It's high time! -

1477
01:50:05.960 --> 01:50:07.710
Either you convince each other...

1478
01:50:08.120 --> 01:50:09.170
- Or convince me.-

1479
01:50:10.370 --> 01:50:11.420
Ashwin?

1480
01:50:12.780 --> 01:50:17.540
Sir, every investigation
follows a prime rule -

1481
01:50:17.540 --> 01:50:19.280
Inquiry, evidence and conclusion...

1482
01:50:19.410 --> 01:50:20.670
You enquire for evidence

1483
01:50:21.210 --> 01:50:22.590
and you come to a conclusion.

1484
01:50:23.830 --> 01:50:25.510
Here everything has backtracked...

1485
01:50:25.790 --> 01:50:27.200
These people first decided

1486
01:50:27.210 --> 01:50:28.410
on the conclusion...

1487
01:50:28.410 --> 01:50:29.870
then dug very hard for evidence.

1488
01:50:29.870 --> 01:50:31.210
You worked hard as well Sir...

1489
01:50:32.300 --> 01:50:35.450
to get the poor, innocent servants

1490
01:50:35.460 --> 01:50:36.580
hung to their deaths.

1491
01:50:36.960 --> 01:50:38.700
If they are innocent, what are you?

1492
01:50:38.700 --> 01:50:41.660
There were four people in the house.

1493
01:50:41.660 --> 01:50:42.920
Two are alive and two dead.

1494
01:50:43.210 --> 01:50:44.260
- As simple as that. -

1495
01:50:44.370 --> 01:50:46.170
Everyone's testimony has changed!

1496
01:50:46.170 --> 01:50:49.040
The maid servant, the forensic
expert, the postmortem doctor!

1497
01:50:49.040 --> 01:50:51.080
So is it as simple as that?

1498
01:50:51.410 --> 01:50:52.460
Yes it is!

1499
01:50:52.500 --> 01:50:54.310
It happened!
- How is it possible? -

1500
01:50:54.460 --> 01:50:55.510
Guys... Please!

1501
01:50:57.000 --> 01:50:58.120
Let's do one thing...

1502
01:50:58.910 --> 01:51:00.330
The second team can present

1503
01:51:00.330 --> 01:51:02.120
whatever new crucial
evidence or testimonies

1504
01:51:02.120 --> 01:51:03.960
- they have discovered... -

1505
01:51:03.960 --> 01:51:07.790
The first team can
examine the credentials.

1506
01:51:07.790 --> 01:51:08.840
- Fair? -

1507
01:51:09.330 --> 01:51:10.380
Fair enough.

1508
01:51:10.380 --> 01:51:11.410
Mr. Paul...

1509
01:51:11.410 --> 01:51:12.460
Sir...

1510
01:51:13.040 --> 01:51:15.080
The biggest issue in this case is whether

1511
01:51:15.120 --> 01:51:17.540
there was anyone else at home that night...

1512
01:51:17.540 --> 01:51:20.290
- The first team says the killer
came from outside, -

1513
01:51:20.290 --> 01:51:22.790
killed Shruti, latched the door and ran.

1514
01:51:22.790 --> 01:51:23.840
Right?

1515
01:51:26.040 --> 01:51:27.090
Wrong.

1516
01:51:30.040 --> 01:51:32.330
The first person to arrive
at the crime scene...

1517
01:51:32.330 --> 01:51:35.080
if I may call her the prime witness...

1518
01:51:37.620 --> 01:51:39.250
The maid servant, Basanti...

1519
01:51:39.750 --> 01:51:41.750
- After both the murders,
the Tandon's -

1520
01:51:41.750 --> 01:51:44.120
had been waiting for her to come.

1521
01:51:44.410 --> 01:51:46.790
- Basanti came, rang the bell, -

1522
01:51:47.330 --> 01:51:48.410
- the door was closed...-

1523
01:51:48.540 --> 01:51:51.460
Then the key is thrown from the balcony...

1524
01:51:52.410 --> 01:51:55.290
I'd like you to look at this door...

1525
01:51:56.750 --> 01:51:58.980
- This door is between
the two front doors, -

1526
01:51:59.210 --> 01:52:00.910
and it opens into Khempal's room.

1527
01:52:04.410 --> 01:52:07.120
Normally, there is a fridge
placed against this door...

1528
01:52:07.410 --> 01:52:08.580
But that morning

1529
01:52:08.580 --> 01:52:10.330
the Tandon's had moved the fridge

1530
01:52:10.330 --> 01:52:12.460
to be able to open the door.

1531
01:52:16.370 --> 01:52:19.160
When Basanti turned to the
stairs to get the key...

1532
01:52:19.230 --> 01:52:23.000
Mrs. Tandon came out
of this very door,

1533
01:52:23.000 --> 01:52:25.000
opened the main door,

1534
01:52:25.620 --> 01:52:27.290
- and went back to throw the key. -

1535
01:52:27.830 --> 01:52:30.290
When Basanti came back up,

1536
01:52:30.290 --> 01:52:31.750
the main door didn't need a key...

1537
01:52:31.750 --> 01:52:33.010
it opened with just a push.

1538
01:52:33.370 --> 01:52:35.660
The front door was
latched from outside,

1539
01:52:35.660 --> 01:52:37.450
just to show that
someone had broken in,

1540
01:52:37.460 --> 01:52:38.710
killed and run away...

1541
01:52:39.500 --> 01:52:42.030
What followed was the
Tandon's acting all shocked...

1542
01:52:42.830 --> 01:52:44.910
When Basanti first came,
did she push

1543
01:52:44.910 --> 01:52:47.020
the main door to check
if it was unlocked?

1544
01:52:47.410 --> 01:52:48.460
Yes she did.

1545
01:52:48.830 --> 01:52:50.500
Her statement doesn't say so.

1546
01:52:51.160 --> 01:52:53.390
No problem, we can take
her statement again.

1547
01:52:53.660 --> 01:52:55.280
By blackmailing her like Gogia?

1548
01:52:55.290 --> 01:52:56.910
Oh come on Ashwin!

1549
01:52:57.830 --> 01:53:00.370
We don't torture people
to make them approvers...

1550
01:53:01.250 --> 01:53:04.260
Sir, do you understand what
these people are trying to say?

1551
01:53:05.290 --> 01:53:06.340
Just imagine...

1552
01:53:07.290 --> 01:53:09.500
I'll throw you the keys.

1553
01:53:11.160 --> 01:53:13.210
The moment Basanti
turns to get the key,

1554
01:53:14.210 --> 01:53:16.000
Nutan runs inside

1555
01:53:16.000 --> 01:53:18.040
and does everything that they are saying...

1556
01:53:34.040 --> 01:53:35.960
Put this back, I'll throw her the keys...

1557
01:53:59.410 --> 01:54:01.640
Quick, let's go! We have
to start crying now...

1558
01:54:36.370 --> 01:54:39.660
Look what, Khempal has done.

1559
01:54:44.040 --> 01:54:45.710
Such intricate planning!

1560
01:54:46.620 --> 01:54:48.730
Two murders, one dead
body on the terrace...

1561
01:54:49.410 --> 01:54:50.790
dressing up the crime scene...

1562
01:54:50.790 --> 01:54:54.660
Moving the fridge, opening the
small door, latching the front door...

1563
01:54:54.660 --> 01:54:56.710
throwing keys, moving
the fridge again...

1564
01:54:57.790 --> 01:54:58.840
All in a flash!

1565
01:54:58.840 --> 01:55:00.750
Are they Spiderman and Superwoman?

1566
01:55:00.750 --> 01:55:01.800
What are they?

1567
01:55:04.890 --> 01:55:07.660
And after all that planning,

1568
01:55:07.660 --> 01:55:11.500
the blood-stained whiskey
bottle on the table...

1569
01:55:12.040 --> 01:55:13.360
they didn't clear that up?

1570
01:55:13.360 --> 01:55:15.410
How come?

1571
01:55:15.410 --> 01:55:17.410
Because they weren't professional killers.

1572
01:55:17.410 --> 01:55:19.040
Sir, it's simple...

1573
01:55:19.410 --> 01:55:22.500
if a father sees his
daughter's dead body...

1574
01:55:23.250 --> 01:55:26.020
will he cry standing outside
the room or run to hug her?

1575
01:55:26.020 --> 01:55:26.950
Has your daughter died?

1576
01:55:26.960 --> 01:55:28.830
Do you know what it
feels like to lose a child?

1577
01:55:28.830 --> 01:55:29.880
And you do?

1578
01:55:31.580 --> 01:55:33.040
To have a daughter,

1579
01:55:33.040 --> 01:55:35.410
you first need a wife...

1580
01:55:36.580 --> 01:55:37.780
You don't even have that.

1581
01:55:39.710 --> 01:55:41.910
We're talking about a
human reaction here...

1582
01:55:42.250 --> 01:55:43.570
That's exactly the point!

1583
01:55:44.250 --> 01:55:46.040
Human reactions can be different...

1584
01:55:46.500 --> 01:55:48.040
How can we generalize this?

1585
01:55:48.790 --> 01:55:49.910
Sir, please note...

1586
01:55:52.250 --> 01:55:55.210
Khempal's throat was slit completely...

1587
01:55:55.410 --> 01:55:56.960
in a full circle.

1588
01:55:59.210 --> 01:56:00.650
The girl's was only half slit.

1589
01:56:02.040 --> 01:56:03.090
SQ?

1590
01:56:04.540 --> 01:56:06.460
Human reaction. She was their daughter...

1591
01:56:07.750 --> 01:56:09.080
Emotional attachment...

1592
01:56:11.250 --> 01:56:14.250
So while murdering his child
the doctor said...

1593
01:56:16.250 --> 01:56:19.290
'Sorry dear, I'm slitting your throat...'

1594
01:56:20.000 --> 01:56:21.330
'Hope you're not in pain?'

1595
01:56:22.040 --> 01:56:24.210
'Almost done...'

1596
01:56:24.660 --> 01:56:26.500
'Just this one vein and you'll die!'

1597
01:56:27.960 --> 01:56:29.040
Let's be serious guys...

1598
01:56:34.410 --> 01:56:37.370
Sorry... but you're right,
their whole theory is a joke.

1599
01:56:37.370 --> 01:56:39.580
The internet router switched on and off

1600
01:56:39.580 --> 01:56:41.000
three times that night...

1601
01:56:42.040 --> 01:56:43.720
That means the parents were awake.

1602
01:56:43.720 --> 01:56:45.540
Next day when all hell broke loose,

1603
01:56:45.540 --> 01:56:46.910
and no one used the computer...

1604
01:56:46.910 --> 01:56:48.960
even then the router
switched on and off...

1605
01:56:48.960 --> 01:56:50.500
The router is made in India.

1606
01:56:50.500 --> 01:56:52.180
It turns on and off at its own will!

1607
01:56:52.180 --> 01:56:54.040
The computer was
actually used that day...

1608
01:56:54.040 --> 01:56:54.950
What for?

1609
01:56:54.960 --> 01:56:56.220
Shruti's friends used it...

1610
01:56:56.620 --> 01:56:57.670
Why?

1611
01:57:00.790 --> 01:57:02.650
To clean up disreputable literature...

1612
01:57:02.870 --> 01:57:03.920
What?

1613
01:57:03.920 --> 01:57:06.080
Porn... Pornographic material...

1614
01:57:06.080 --> 01:57:07.130
- You don't know? -

1615
01:57:07.830 --> 01:57:09.290
Okay... Testimony?

1616
01:57:09.620 --> 01:57:10.910
Off the record.

1617
01:57:10.910 --> 01:57:11.830
Why?

1618
01:57:11.830 --> 01:57:14.290
What would people say about the girl?

1619
01:57:16.410 --> 01:57:17.540
Oh... Compassion!

1620
01:57:18.410 --> 01:57:22.710
So Mr. Compassionate, what
was the motive for the murder?

1621
01:57:23.160 --> 01:57:24.290
Sudden rage.

1622
01:57:24.290 --> 01:57:26.370
Why?

1623
01:57:26.370 --> 01:57:27.910
The doctor found his
daughter and his servant

1624
01:57:27.910 --> 01:57:30.120
in a Sacrilegious Disposition.

1625
01:57:30.410 --> 01:57:32.910
Then he lost his self-control and...

1626
