1630
01:57:45.240 --> 01:57:48.700
The golf club was in the girl's room?

1631
01:57:48.710 --> 01:57:50.910
No, in the servant's room...

1632
01:57:53.710 --> 01:57:56.200
So the doctor found them in a sacre...

1633
01:57:56.210 --> 01:57:57.620
sacremonious?

1634
01:57:57.620 --> 01:57:58.620
Sacrilegious disposition?

1635
01:57:58.620 --> 01:57:59.910
Yes... in that disposition...

1636
01:58:00.960 --> 01:58:03.310
And he ran out of the room
to fetch his golf club...

1637
01:58:03.790 --> 01:58:06.440
And by the time he came back,
the servant and the girl...

1638
