What activities?

1659
01:58:53.210 --> 01:58:54.260
Wife swapping-

1660
01:58:54.260 --> 01:58:56.910
That was the only way she could retaliate

1661
01:58:56.910 --> 01:58:58.040
and hurt them

1662
