1686
02:00:13.410 --> 02:00:14.490
We have the testimony.

1687
02:00:15.410 --> 02:00:19.620
That means he reached the
Tandon house at 12:50 am.

1688
02:00:20.290 --> 02:00:21.830
As per the postmortem,

1689
02:00:22.460 --> 02:00:24.750
