between 12 and 1 at night...

1690
02:00:25.580 --> 02:00:28.250
The same doctor has given

1691
02:00:28.250 --> 02:00:29.750
the time of murder as 12 noon.

1692
02:00:29.750 --> 02:00:31.450
He was just confused...

1693
02:00:31.460 --> 02:00:32.780
When the girl was in school...

1694
02:00:32.790 --> 02:00:35.040
- He jumbled up the AM and PM...-

1695
02:00:35.040 --> 02:00:37.120
Screw his AM and PM!

1696
02:00:38.410 --> 02:00:41.060
His reports have changed
four times in three years!

1697
02:00:41.540 --> 02:00:45.200
Either the vaginal
swab is contaminated,

1698
02:00:45.210 --> 02:00:47.250
- or the finding is 'subjective'... -

1699
02:00:47.250 --> 02:00:49.160
First they said the Khukri killed her,

1700
02:00:49.160 --> 02:00:51.140
now they say it's a surgical instrument.

1701
02:00:51.140 --> 02:00:53.040
In the Narco tests the servants gave

1702
02:00:53.040 --> 02:00:54.720
