1703
02:00:55.150 --> 02:00:58.500
You did a Narco test on the parents.

1704
02:00:58.500 --> 02:00:59.640
Did you find anything?

1705
02:01:00.410 --> 02:01:02.910
The first team's Narco
report is fabricated...

1706
02:01:03.210 --> 02:01:06.000
These are the CDs of the original report...

1707
02:01:06.000 --> 02:01:07.050
You can have a look...

1708
02:01:09.080 --> 02:01:12.080
As per your Narco tests,

1709
02:01:12.080 --> 02:01:14.200
the murderers destroyed Khempal's

1710
02:01:14.210 --> 02:01:16.210
and Shruti's cell phones.

1711
02:01:17.870 --> 02:01:19.790
Six months later the girl's phone

1712
